    "text": "<p>Sodium metal :</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mfenced><mi>KE</mi></mfenced><mi>max</mi></msub></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>call</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p>Cell reaction</p><p>Cathode :&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AgCl</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Ag</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>Cl</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Anode :&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math></p><p>Overall ;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AgCl</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Ag</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>Cl</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\